  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1402.06 Nonaffiliated",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1402.06 “Nonaffiliated” means entities which are not controlled by or under common control of, and are not part of any group acting in concert which controls, directly or indirectly, the applicable entity.\n\nSource. #14068, eff 9-3-24",
